  "description": "Story Outline – Playful Outline Bubble Font\nBring a whimsical storybook charm to your creative projects with Story Outline! This delightful outline font features chunky, rounded bubble letters with a clean, friendly look. Perfect for children’s books, custom stickers, classroom crafts, t-shirt prints, SVG cutting files, and cheerful greeting cards.\nWhether you are designing for Cricut, Silhouette, or print-on-demand merchandise, Story Outline brings a fun, hand-drawn retro feel that makes your designs stand out.",
